अभिनियोगः Close application,
attention or intentness, absorption;
कार्य˚ Mu. 1.

अभिनिवेशिन् a.
1 Devoted to,
intent on, adhering or clinging to;
कल्याणाभिनिवेशिनः K. 136 of blessed
or noble resolve, 191.
--2 Fixing on,
directing or turning (the mind) to;
गुणेष्वभिनिवेशिनो भर्तुरपि प्रिया M. 3;
अहो नु खलु दुर्लभ ˚शी मदनः V. 1;
Dk. 57.
--3 Determined, resolute.

अभिमंतृ a. Longing for;
self-conceited, referring all objects to self;
Ms. 1. 14.

1 Egotism.
--2 Love;
copulation, sexual union.

अभिमाय a. [अभिगतो मायामविद्यां]
Bewildered (इतिकर्तव्यतामूढ);
ignorant, foolish.

अभियातृ, --यातिन् a. Approaching,
assailing, encountering; assailant;
रामभियायिनां तेषां R. 12. 43.

