अभिशंक् {c1c} A. To doubt,
mistrust, suspect, be suspicious of (with
acc. of person or thing);
माभिशंकीर्वचो मम Mb.; Mk. 9. 8; Ms. 8. 96;
also with abl.; be afraid of; Bk. 6. 2.

