conjunction, contact; sexual
connection; Ms. 5. 63.

अभिहत p. p.
1 Struck(fig. also),
beaten, smitten, attacked, injured;
[]
धाराभिरातप इवाभिहतं सरोजं M. 5. 3,
Amaru. 2; struck against (as sound);
Śik. 9.
--2 Struck, affected, overcome;
शोक˚, काम˚, दुःख˚, क्षुत्तृषा˚.
--3
